# Humilau City (houses on stilts over a calm sea, boardwalks in the sun): a lazy marimba tune in F major over a harp that rocks
# on each chord, a round bass and a soft beat of brushes. At night a flute takes the tune, slower. Original composition for this
# game (plan 22 · U8, part b).
